 Windows 7 Enhanced edition  (KDE theme pack)
 Enhanced by : Leon Khoo
 Based on    : "Plasma SVG Win7 Theme" by Blackcrack / Blackysgate.de

 The original theme and its artwork remain the work of the original
 author. This enhanced edition adds touched-up metadata, a user-level
 install script and further icon refinements, while keeping the original
 authorship and license intact.

 Components in this pack
 -----------------------
   icons/windows-7-enhanced           icon theme (original artwork by
                                      Blackcrack / Blackysgate.de)
   color-schemes/Windows7Enhanced     Windows 7 Aero color scheme
   look-and-feel/windows-7-enhanced   Plasma global theme (look-and-feel)
   kvantum/windows-7-enhnaced         Kvantum widget theme

 Bundled third-party components (GPL, aggregated - not CC BY-NC-SA)
 ------------------------------------------------------------------
   ExposeAir Plasma theme + Aurorae decoration + color scheme
                                      Mark Whittaker (GPL)
   windows7splash                     luis-pseudo / AudacityXD62 (GPL)
   (Kvantum engine itself is not bundled - install the kvantum package)

 Excluded (no clear open license): "Win7Bulid-cursors" cursor theme and the
 original pack's wallpaper images. See LICENSES.md.

 License summary: the project's own files (icon theme, color scheme, global
 theme, Kvantum theme) are CC BY-NC-SA, matching the original icon theme.
 Bundled third-party themes keep their own GPL licenses. See COPYING,
 LICENSES.md and third-party/NOTICE.md.
 ------------------------------------------------------------------------
